📊 Key Business Insights

The following insights were derived from the Superstore Sales & Profit Dashboard using Excel Pivot Tables, Pivot Charts, slicers, and interactive visualizations.

💰 Overall Performance

Total Sales: $2.30M
Total Profit: $286.40K
Total Quantity Sold: 37.87K units
Number of Customers: 9,994
Overall Profit Margin: approximately 12%

🌎 Regional Performance

The West region generated the highest sales, approximately $725.46K.
The East region generated approximately $678.78K.
The Central region generated approximately $501.24K.
The South region recorded the lowest sales at approximately $391.72K.

🗺️ State-Level Insights

California was the top-performing state, generating approximately $457.69K in sales and $76.38K in profit.
New York generated approximately $310.88K in sales and $74.04K in profit.
Texas generated approximately $170.19K in sales but recorded a loss of $25.73K, indicating a significant profitability issue.
Pennsylvania also generated a loss of approximately $15.56K despite sales of approximately $116.51K.
Florida, Illinois, and Ohio also recorded negative profit, highlighting areas that require further profitability analysis.

📦 Category & Sub-Category Insights

Technology was the highest-selling category with approximately $836.15K in sales.
Furniture generated approximately $742.00K.
Office Supplies generated approximately $719.05K.
Phones were one of the highest-selling sub-categories, generating approximately $330.01K.
Chairs generated approximately $328.45K in sales.
Copiers generated approximately $149.53K in sales but produced the highest sub-category profit of $55.62K.
Tables generated approximately $206.97K in sales but resulted in a loss of $17.73K.
Bookcases and Supplies also recorded negative profit.

👥 Customer Segment Insights

Consumer customers contributed the highest sales at approximately $1.16M.
Corporate customers contributed approximately $706.15K.
Home Office customers contributed approximately $429.65K.
The Consumer segment therefore represents the largest contributor to overall revenue.

📅 Monthly Sales & Profit Trends

November recorded the highest monthly sales at approximately $352.46K.
December followed with approximately $325.29K.
September generated approximately $36.86K in profit.
December recorded the highest monthly profit at approximately $43.37K.
The monthly trend indicates noticeable variation in both sales and profitability throughout the year.

🚚 Shipping Mode Insights

Standard Class generated the highest sales at approximately $1.36M.
Second Class generated approximately $459.19K.
First Class generated approximately $351.43K.
Same Day generated approximately $128.36K.

⚠️ Key Business Opportunities
Investigate Texas and Pennsylvania to understand the reasons behind negative profitability despite substantial sales.
Review pricing, discounts, and product costs for loss-making sub-categories such as Tables, Bookcases, and Supplies.
Technology is the strongest overall category and could be examined for opportunities to increase high-margin sales.
California and New York are important markets due to their strong sales and profitability.
The Consumer segment is the largest revenue contributor and represents an important customer group for retention and growth strategies.
